// pages from the OS (extern "libc": the C compiler checks each against <sys/mman.h>); the flags are the C constants
// prompt: libc mmap(2) of len bytes; the result is region memory (Srs.Mem) or MAP_FAILED (address -1, checked by Srs.Arena.map).
extern "libc" def mmap(addr: Srs.Mem, len: U64, prot: I32, flags: I32, fd: I32, off: I64): Srs.Mem

